# LANDER MODE. jeromebaker.com serves the "Pick your Jerome" page at / and everything else goes to the old store untouched.
# __OLD_HOST__ is filled in by build.sh (env OLD_HOST). Static files (the lander itself) win over these rules.
# 302 on purpose: temporary, so Google keeps the old URLs indexed until real cutover.
# the lander's own address is the real site until cutover: no duplicate on the netlify.app host
https://jerome-baker-site.netlify.app/*  https://jeromebaker.com/:splat  301!
# www: home goes to the root, every other path goes straight to the old store in one hop
https://www.jeromebaker.com/  https://jeromebaker.com/  301!
https://www.jeromebaker.com/*  https://__OLD_HOST__/:splat  302!
# new-site sections that have no old-store address: send them to the new site until cutover instead of the old store 404
/story  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/story/  302
/story/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/story/:splat  302
/crew  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/crew/  302
/crew/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/crew/:splat  302
/glass  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/glass/  302
/glass/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/glass/:splat  302
/travel  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/travel/  302
/travel/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/travel/:splat  302
/comics  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/comics/  302
/comics/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/comics/:splat  302
/returns  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/returns/  302
/returns/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/returns/:splat  302
/privacy  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/privacy/  302
/privacy/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/privacy/:splat  302
/terms  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/terms/  302
/terms/*  https://jeromebaker.cannacrypted.com/terms/:splat  302
/*  https://__OLD_HOST__/:splat  302
